msgstr ""

#. §0: ```
#. hPQ : ¬ Q → ¬ P
#. ```
#. §1: `hnQ : ¬ Q`
#. §2: `obtain`
#. §3: `exact`
#: Game.Levels.ArgWorld.L02_arg
msgid "Great! We now have\n"
"§0\n"
"and §1. We can now use the tactics §2 and §3 the same way we did in the last level. Or we can take a shortcut...\n"
""
